    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a delightful journey to uncover <strong>100 adorable cats</strong> hidden across a beautifully illustrated <strong>Shanghai</strong> setting. From bustling markets to serene gardens, every scene is brimming with details and feline surprises waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Shanghai</strong>: Dive into hand-drawn scenes inspired by Shanghai's vibrant culture and architecture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find All 100 Cats</strong>: Test your observation skills and uncover every hidden feline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted Artwork</strong>: Start with monochromatic illustrations that fill with color as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Gameplay</strong>: Perfect for unwinding with calming visuals and lo-fi music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a cat lover or a fan of hidden object games, this cozy adventure will bring you joy and relaxation. Can you find them all? <strong>Start your search today!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a delightful journey to uncover <strong>100 adorable cats</strong> hidden across a beautifully illustrated <strong>Shanghai</strong> setting. From bustling markets to serene gardens, every scene is brimming with details and feline surprises waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Shanghai</strong>: Dive into hand-drawn scenes inspired by Shanghai's vibrant culture and architecture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find All 100 Cats</strong>: Test your observation skills and uncover every hidden feline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted Artwork</strong>: Start with monochromatic illustrations that fill with color as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Gameplay</strong>: Perfect for unwinding with calming visuals and lo-fi music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a cat lover or a fan of hidden object games, this cozy adventure will bring you joy and relaxation. Can you find them all? <strong>Start your search today!</strong></p>",
